[32m+[m[32m## Open the project's prompt[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAfter the explicit lock and build above, `session` opens the assembled executable's[m
[32m+[m[32mREPL with its native extensions, including Polars. `eval` takes exactly one source[m
